rification\n- **Replacement target:** text archive 374 msg 1\n- **Other affected callers or records:** None found (L26 only).\n- **Unresolved questions:** None.\n- **Validation needed:** Text-box fit after any edit.\n\n"}},"sourceMetadata":{"mapHeaders":[33,134],"scriptFiles":[225,226],"levelScripts":[470,471],"textArchives":[373,374],"eventFiles":[30,130],"timing":"Static encounters apply throughout the narrative. Time/day/choice branches remain distinct conditions. The tutorial’s exact prerequisite lab scene and Tuscany’s badge gate are unresolved; no alphabetical narrative stages are assigned to them."}},{"id":"cherrygrove-city","name":"Cherrygrove City","subtitle":"The City of Fragrant Flowers","locations":[{"id":"cgc-outdoors","name":"Outdoors","areaIds":["67"]},{"id":"cgc-mart","name":"Poké Mart","areaIds":["68"]},{"id":"cgc-center","name":"Pokémon Center","areaIds":["69","144"],"expandAreas":true},{"id":"cgc-west-house","name":"West House","areaIds":["70"]},{"id":"cgc-middle-house","name":"Middle House (Probably Guide Gent’s)","areaIds":["71"]},{"id":"cgc-east-house","name":"East House","areaIds":["72"]}],"areas":[{"id":"67","name":"Cherrygrove City Outdoors","floor":"Outdoors","code":"T21","elements":[{"id":"cgc-element-067-02","name":"The Guide Gent Shows You Around Town","events":["CGC-EVT-067-02","CGC-EVT-067-01"],"context":"[CGC-EVT-067-02] [CGC-EVT-067-01]\n\nThe old man stands on the road in the middle of town until the scene starts. Talking to him before then does nothing.\n\n","kind":"scene","gender":"both","points":[{"id":"cgc-element-067-02-0","condition":"the first time you step onto a strip of road on the east side of town. The following messages and actions occur in source order. The guide’s local A–D sequence is not the engine’s global A–J timeline. Tour and Map Card use global Stage V (The Errand), and the rival scene uses Stage VI (Return Home), as coarse inferred placements. Unknown later-story thresholds remain Other Conditions. Static content appears throughout; source conditions remain authoritative.","stages":["E"],"ids":["CGC-DLG-067-02a","CGC-DLG-067-02b","CGC-DLG-067-02c","CGC-DLG-067-02d","CGC-DLG-067-02e","CGC-DLG-067-02f","CGC-DLG-067-02g","CGC-DLG-067-02h","CGC-DLG-067-02i"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","text":"the first time you step onto a strip of road on the east side of town.","gender":"both","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-0"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"You’re a rookie Trainer, aren’t you?\nI can tell!\n\nThat’s OK! Everyone is a rookie\nat some point!\n\nIf you’d like, I can teach you a\nfew things.\n\nOK, then! Follow me!","gender":"both","sourceIds":["CGC-DLG-067-02a"],"rawMessageData":"You’re a rookie Trainer, aren’t you?\\nI can tell!\\rThat’s OK! Everyone is a rookie\\nat some point!\\rIf you’d like, I can teach you a\\nfew things.\\fOK, then! Follow me!\\r","speaker":"cgc-actor-guide-gent","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-1"},{"type":"note","text":"He walks up to you first. [CGC-DLG-067-02a]","gender":"both","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-2"},{"type":"note","text":"straight after the line above.","gender":"both","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-3"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Ohh... I’m sorry.\nI forgot that you weren’t wearing the\n\nRunning Shoes!\n\nI’ll try to go as slow as possible, so\ntry keeping up!","gender":"both","sourceIds":["CGC-DLG-067-02b"],"rawMessageData":"Ohh... I’m sorry.\\nI forgot that you weren’t wearing the\\fRunning Shoes!\\rI’ll try to go as slow as possible, so\\ntry keeping up!\\r","speaker":"cgc-actor-guide-gent","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-4"},{"type":"note","text":"He starts walking and you follow. [CGC-DLG-067-02b]","gender":"both","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-5"},{"type":"note","text":"at the first stop, the Pokémon Center.","gender":"both","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-6"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"This is a Pokémon Center. They heal\nyour Pokémon in no time at all.\n\nYou’ll be relying on them a lot, so\nyou better learn about them.","gender":"both","sourceIds":["CGC-DLG-067-02c"],"rawMessageData":"This is a Pokémon Center. They heal\\nyour Pokémon in no time at all.\\rYou’ll be relying on them a lot, so\\nyou better learn about them.\\r","speaker":"cgc-actor-guide-gent","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-7"},{"type":"note","text":"at the second stop, the Pokémon Mart.","gender":"both","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-8"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"This is a Pokémon Mart.\nThey sell Poké Balls for catching wild\n\nPokémon and other useful items.","gender":"both","sourceIds":["CGC-DLG-067-02d"],"rawMessageData":"This is a Pokémon Mart.\\nThey sell Poké Balls for catching wild\\fPokémon and other useful items.\\r","speaker":"cgc-actor-guide-gent","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-9"},{"type":"note","text":"at the third stop, where Route 30 starts.","gender":"both","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-10"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Route 30 is out this way.\n\nTrainers will be battling their\nPokémon there.\n\nIf you go a little farther,\nyou’ll see Mr. Pokémon’s House.","gender":"both","sourceIds":["CGC-DLG-067-02e"],"rawMessageData":"Route 30 is out this way.\\rTrainers will be battling their\\nPokémon there.\\rIf you go a little farther,\\nyou’ll see Mr. Pokémon’s House.\\r","speaker":"cgc-actor-guide-gent","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-11"},{"type":"note","text":"at the fourth stop, by the sea. A sound of waves plays while he speaks.","gender":"both","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-12"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"This is the sea, as you can see.\n\nSome Pokémon are found only in water.","gender":"both","sourceIds":["CGC-DLG-067-02f"],"rawMessageData":"This is the sea, as you can see.\\rSome Pokémon are found only in water.\\r","speaker":"cgc-actor-guide-gent","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-13"},{"type":"note","text":"at the last stop, outside his own house.","gender":"both","id":"cgc-element-067-02-0-block-14"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Here...\nIt’s my house!\n\nFor your effort keeping up wit